notes.content:
Hello, there!

The patch #2 is ready. Go to update, guys!

What’s new?

1. Updated influence logics

 - The player gets influence points by buying companies’ shares. The larger a company, the more influence points you have;
- The player spends influence points to negotiate; 
- In negotiations,  you can only decrease the failure risk by spending influence points.

2. Updated loyalty logics

- At the beginning of the game, characters’ loyalty to the player is up to his political views, religion and marital status;
- The higher a character’s loyalty to the player, the less influence points you need to negotiate; 
- New modifiers of loyalty have been added into the game.

3. Updated assistants stuff

- Hire an assistant without power points;
- Your assistants won’t be able to move between states.

4. Auction

- Added ‘Quit’ button;
- Fixed bidding logics;
- Fixed the price balance of property;
- Fixed the process of generation of lots (it depends on the player wealth - of 0 to 10%;
- Fixed the bug ‘zero ask of lots’;
- Added new types of property;
- Fixed the mechanics of lots selling at auction;

5. Fixed save/load.

6. Added the opportunity to hire a director through shareholders vote.

7. Fixed some critical bugs:

- Economics;
- Negotiations;
- Fixed news bugs;
- Other bugs - music, texts, images and so on.

8. Updated the logics and gameplay of some agents:

- Agents can fail their missions avoiding arrest;
- Use the agent ‘Courtesan’ to improve a character’s loyalty to the player.

9. Updated ‘time’ button:
- Right-click to speed up game time or go to the next event. 

10. Board of Directors

- Being a board member, the player gets influence points.

11. Director’s skill ‘economics’ . It increases a company’s profitability.

